# ============================================================================
#  pdufa.bio — .gitignore
#  CRITICAL: this repo must NEVER contain API keys or the multi-GB caches.
#  Verify `git status` shows NO .env / .env_master before your first push.
# ============================================================================

# --- SECRETS (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/.env_master
Odin Perfection/
*_secret*
*apikey*
*api_key*

# --- large data caches / exports (not needed to build or run the site) ---
uw_export_2026/
orats_backtest_cache/
backtest_progress/
*orats*cache*/
readout_price_cache.json
bifrost_price_cache.json
catalyst_ctgov_cache.json
ctgov_cache.json
chembl_enrichment_cache*.json
finbrain_enrichment*.json
xbi_daily_cache.json
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.bin
*.h5
*.xlsx
*.csv

# site-data CSVs the site + CI guards depend on — re-include despite the *.csv rule above
!readout_miner.csv
!catalysts_out/conference_presentations_history.csv
!catalysts_out/catalysts_public.csv
!conf_study/conference_runup_PUBLISHED.csv

# --- model artifacts / research (not part of the site) ---
gungnir_*.json
odin_v*_deploy.json
bifrost_v*_deploy.json
*_kaizen_results.json

# --- deploy / build junk ---
.vercel
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak_*
logs/
runs/
.odin_api_cache*/
.~lock.*#
*.tmp

# ============================================================================
#  What SHOULD be committed (the Action needs these — do NOT ignore them):
#    pdufa_site_src/            the site + api/data.js + api/v1/*.mjs
#    tests/test_*.py            the CI guards
#    polygon_enrich.py  build_home_board.py  check_pdufa_decided.py
#    catalyst_crawler.py  merge_crawl_to_slate.py
#    catalysts_out/universe_effective.txt
#    catalysts_out/catalysts_public.csv   (force-add: git add -f, despite *.csv above)
#    .github/workflows/          the rebuild workflow
# ============================================================================

runup_t120_cache.json
dash_sweep_review.txt
*.bak_t120
*.bak_extend
*.bak_board

# Local scratch/cache trees. Never part of the deploy; `git add -A` used to sweep 13k of these in.
.odin_cache_v4/
opt_charts/
Momentum Scanner/
smart_money_cache/
phase_readout_cache/
daily_scans/
readout_runs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bulk data artifacts. These are local caches and raw dumps, regenerable from
# their source APIs, and none of them is an input to the site build.
#
# Added after a `git add -A` at repo root swept in a 1.8 GB `full database.xml`
# and GitHub's pre-receive hook rejected the push (100 MB file limit). The push
# failing was the good outcome; the bad one is a multi-gigabyte blob entering
# history, where it is permanent and every future clone pays for it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
full database.xml
odin_catalyst_database.json
form4_transactions.json
finbrain_raw_cache.json
conf_study/si_panel_*.csv.gz
orats_backtest_cache/
backtest_progress/
*.tar.gz
# board/page backups written by builders; never content
pdufa_site_src/**/*.bak*
pdufa_site_src/*.bak*
